% Toy example for completing weak derivations with global bounds { 0 }
% - D3 is derived before B4 and must therefore be completed with the global bound x <= 10 from the CON section
% - B4 is a global bound change x <= 5 from the DER section (marked with "global")
% - D5 is derived after B4 and can only be completed with the tighter global bound x <= 5
VER 1.1
VAR 2
x y
INT 0
OBJ max
2  0 2  1 1
CON 3 0
C1 L 10  1  0 1
C2 L 8   2  0 1  1 1
C3 G 3   1  1 1
RTP range -inf 13
SOL 0
DER 3
D3 L 18  2  0 2  1 1  { lin weak { 0 } 1  1 1 } -1
B4 L 5   1  0 1       { lin 2  1 1  2 -1 } -1 global
D5 L 13  OBJ        { lin weak { 0 } 1  1 1 } -1
